* Duplicate keys
  :PROPERTIES:
  :X: 2
  :END:
* Keys with dash and plus
  :PROPERTIES:
  :foo-bar: 1
  :tags+: x
  :END:
* Empty value and aligned values
  :PROPERTIES:
  :EMPTY: 
  :ID: abc
  :URL: https://example.com/a:b
  :END:
* Unterminated drawer
  :PROPERTIES:
  :ID: 1
  :END:
  body that the drawer swallowed
* Drawer content that isn't a property
  :PROPERTIES:
  :ID: 2
  :END:
  just text
* Empty drawer
* Empty drawer, then a planning-like body line
  :PROPERTIES:
  :END:
  SCHEDULED: <2026-11-22 Sun>
* Lowercase drawer markers
  :properties:
  :ID: 3
  :end:
